# ChartVolt Competitions Page — Design Reference

**Status:** BUILT (presentation layer) — desktop arena rebuild matching owner target imagery and Menuitems graphics.

## Source

Owner task brief (rebuild `/competitions` presentation only). Graphics from `design-reference/Menuitems/` copied to `public/assets/neon/competitions/`.

## Built architecture

| Piece | Path |
|---|---|
| Game definitions | `lib/competitions/game-definitions.ts` |
| CTA engine | `lib/competitions/competition-cta.ts` |
| Presentation mapper | `lib/competitions/build-competition-presentation.ts` |
| Arena shell | `components/competitions/arena/CompetitionsArena.tsx` |
| Page wiring | `app/(root)/competitions/page-content.tsx` |

## Rules preserved

- Backend join / lobby / Join GM unchanged — CTA links to lobby; `PrivateContestGate` still owns GM accept.
- Poll, wallet refresh, stale-status transitions kept.
- Filters persist in `localStorage` (`competition-filters`).
- Game-agnostic cards via `gameDefinitions` + `buildCompetitionPresentation`.

## Not in this slice

- Mobile-specific competitions layout (uses same arena shell; responsive wrap).
- New GM system (explicitly refused).
- Hardcoded Trading-only metrics.
